French (Switzerland)|fr_CH
Georgian|ge
German|de
German (Switzerland)|de_CH-latin1
Greek|gr
Hebrew|il
Hungarian|hu
Icelandic|is-latin1
Irish|ie
Italian|it
Japanese|jp106
Kazakh|kazakh
Khmer (Cambodia)|khmer
Kyrgyz|kyrgyz
